227536496,226999895,Cantharellus pellucidus,Data Deficient,,2023,2020-11-09 00:00:00 UTC,3.1,English,"This species has been recorded growing in Peradeniya, Sri Lanka. No further occurrences appear to be recorded outside of this species' initial type collection. Because of this, it is currently not possible to determine the population trend of this species. Therefore, this species is listed as Data Deficient until further information regarding this species' wild population distribution, habitat preferences, and potential threats arises.","This species was initially found growing on the bark of living trees in Peradeniya (Petch 1915), however the species of these trees are unknown.",Further investigation with regards to the full distribution of the species will be required before an accurate assessment of the threats it faces can be made.,"The current status of this species' wild population cannot be determined at this time, and without further research, its current trends remain uncertain.",Unknown,"This species was originally described as growing in Peradeniya, Sri Lanka (Petch 1915).",,Terrestrial,"The current wild population status of this species cannot be determined at this time. Further research is required in order to assess the current population status of this species, as well as the threats which may be affecting it, in order to accurately determine its classification. Further information into the habitat of this species, and specifically which species of trees it may grow on, could also be useful in assessing if this species may be in decline.",Indomalayan,,false,false,Global
